        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.083,
            0.468,
            0.141
          ],
          "content": "Can you observe and list some plants around you that grow this way?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.495,
            0.085,
            0.754,
            0.134
          ],
          "content": "How do bamboo and sugarcane grow into new plants? I have <u>never seen their seeds.</u>"
        },
        {
