        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.286,
            0.743,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "z Make sure they get all the conditions they need to grow—like water, air, and sunlight."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.324,
            0.744,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "z Watch them every day and note how many days it takes for roots stem and leaves to appear. Also observe when the first new leaf appears."
        },
