            0.745,
            0.477
          ],
          "content": "Not just plants – microbes and simple animals also reproduceot just plants—microbes and simple animals also reproduce asexually. For example, single-celled organisms like bacteria andsexually. For example, single-celled organisms like bacteria and amoebae divide into two identical individuals. Some multicellularmoeba divide into two identical individuals. Some multicellula"
