          "content": "organisms like algae can regrow from small cut parts.rganisms like algae can r grow from sm ll cut parts Hydra, another simple animal, grows tiny buds on itsydra, another simple animal, grows tiny buds on its body that break off and grow into new individuals.ody that breaks off and grow into new individuals."
